        },
        "pose_derivation": "station dock point (Stonefish world 3.59, 0.325, 3.91) minus 1.5 m along x_W gives the AUV dock point; a level AUV heading north (yaw_W 0) then has cg_link at (1.695, 0.325, 3.78); in the controller's world_ned (x_C = -y_W, y_C = x_W + 3.8, yaw_C = yaw_W + 1.571) that is (-0.325, 5.495, 3.78), yaw 1.571",
        "timing": "approach dwell 200 s: in the arm64 dev loop the nominal x/y gains overshot the 5.5 m approach to 0.83 m and needed about 100 s more to settle, so the 60 s hold starts after settling"
      }
